---
import Header from "./SectionHeader.astro"; import Token from "./Token.astro"; import {tokens,layer} from "./data";
---
<Header title="Variables" eyebrow="Reference">The provisional Tupak starter tokens as CSS variables for the active color mode. Tailwind mappings remain in tokens.css. Click a name to copy var(--name); Shift+click copies the resolved value. Values update when you switch mode.</Header>
<div class="no-print mb-6 flex flex-wrap items-end gap-4 border-b border-border pb-4"><label class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-xs">Search tokens<input id="token-query" class="mt-2 block w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-background p-2 text-sm" placeholder="Search name, value or description" /></label><label class="text-xs">Layer<select id="token-layer" class="mt-2 block rounded-md border border-input bg-background p-2 text-sm">{["all","semantic","ramp","foundation","component"].map(l=><option value={l}>{l}</option>)}</select></label><span class="sg-value" id="token-count" role="status"></span></div>
<div class="sg-scroll"><table class="sg-table sg-variable-table-width print:min-w-0"><thead><tr><th>Token</th><th>Value</th><th>Layer</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody>{tokens.map(t=><tr data-token-row data-token-layer={layer(t)}><td><Token name={t.name} color={layer(t)==="semantic"||layer(t)==="ramp"} /></td><td class="max-w-xs break-words"><span class="sg-value" data-css-value={t.name} data-color={layer(t)==="semantic"||layer(t)==="ramp"||undefined}></span></td><td class="sg-value">{layer(t)}</td><td class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">{t.description}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><p id="token-empty" class="py-12 text-center text-muted-foreground" hidden>No tokens match your search.</p>
